id: og_terminus_b
name: Terminus II
description: Terminus. A freight terminus whose overhead concourse watches the platforms it cannot reach, while the way across nobody can see runs under the tracks. Built as a rail freight interchange; the yard has been shut down mid-shift and the signals are dark.

